  "title": "LOEWS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON COMMON STOCK",
  "summary": "Loews Corporation (NYSE: L) announced today the declaration of the Company's quarterly dividend of $0.0625 per share of Common Stock, payable September 1, 2026 to shareholders of record as of the close of business on August 19, 2026. Loews Corporation is a diversified company with businesses in the insurance, energy, hospitality, and packaging industries. For more information please visit www.loews.com . View original content: https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/loews-corporation-announces-quarterly-dividend-on-common-stock-302842652.html SOURCE Loews Corporation",
